      "code": "md_size = mdlen + padding;",
      "note": "md_size (uint8_t) is set to ROUND_UP(mdlen,4): with mdlen=250 and padding=2 it becomes 252, which is greater than NSH_CTX_HDRS_MAX_LEN (248) -- the 512-byte buf can carry more decoded metadata than the 248-byte ofpbuf stub buffer size, so md_size overstates the bytes actually present in 'metadata'.",
      "role": "root_cause"
